      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "OBJECTIVE",
          "Label": "PURPOSE",
          "content": "The paper describes the clinical characteristics of patients with aspirin-induced asthma and/or urticaria, angioedema, shock, the results of the challenge tests and the evolution of this disease."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "MAIN POINT",
          "content": "The authors present the different arguments supporting the physiopathological mechanisms from genetics to the inhibition of cyclooxugenase or the leukotriene hypothesis."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "PROSPECTIVES",
          "content": "Finally, they recall the methodology to be used for a good clinical practice on this controversial field of research."
        }
      ]},
